 de Magali Croset-Calisto, 

00:53:31.560 --> 00:53:34.520 line:95%
<c.yellow> "La révolution du No Sex". </c>

00:53:35.600 --> 00:53:40.200 line:95%
<c.yellow> Magali Croset-Calisto explique, 
 par contre, justement, </c>

00:53:40.360 --> 00:53:44.640 size:78% position:39% line:95%
