 c'est-à-dire l'affaiblissement 

00:53:44.800 --> 00:53:46.760 size:61% position:30% line:78%
 des relations sexuelles 

00:53:47.760 --> 00:53:48.880 line:95%
<c.yellow> en partie contesté </c>

00:53:49.040 --> 00:53:49.960 line:95%
 par vous-même, 

00:53:50.120 --> 00:53:51.440 line:95%
<c.yellow> mais elle le montre. </c>

00:53:51.600 --> 00:53:54.240 line:95%
 Alors, Giulia Sissa, 
 vous avez publié 

00:53:54.400 --> 00:53:57.440 line:95%
<c.yellow> "Le pouvoir des femmes" 
 chez Odile Jacob. </c>

00:53:57.600 --> 00:53:59.520 line:95%
<c.yellow> Bon, c'est évident. </c>

00:53:59.680 --> 00:54:02.480 line:95%
<c.yellow> En un mot, en un mot ! 
 Parce qu'on a peu de temps. </c>

00:54:02.640 --> 00:54:05.520 line:95%
<c.yellow> Il se raffermit 
 ou il diminue ? </c>

00:54:06.720 --> 00:54:08.720 size:34% position:17% line:94%
<c.yellow> En un mot. 
</c> 
 *-On avance. 

00:54:08.880 --> 00:54:10.880 size:29% position:15% line:95%
 On avance, 
 on avance. 

00:54:11.040 --> 00:54:12.600 line:95%
<c.yellow> -Vous avancez. </c>

00:54:12.760 --> 00:54:14.480 line:95%
<c.yellow> *-Oui, on avance. 
 Nous avançons </c>

00:54:14.640 --> 00:54:16.520 size:63% position:32% line:95%
